      "id": "claim_09d0efe841924e6b8218b47a39114ecc",
      "statement": "CompletionStrategy has exactly three values: FORBIDDEN (default single-request), PAGINATE (parallel per-page extraction plus merge), and CONCATENATE (multi-part raw continuations stitched into one JSON).",
