      "statement": "Extractor dispatches non-FORBIDDEN strategies both via extract_with_strategy (which passes raw loaded page content to the handlers) and inside _extract (which passes built messages), so handlers receive different payload shapes depending on entry path; unsupported strategies raise ValueError.",
