      "statement": "Scalar field disagreements become {'_conflict': True, 'candidates': [...]} placeholders; conflict resolution requests a ConflictResolution model from the LLM with the original pages and candidates as context, raising ValueError with context-size hints on failure, and unresolved conflicts defensively fall back to the first candidate.",
